All right, here are some questions:

1. Exactly how does a bag of holding work ( ie: what dictates the amount it
   can hold ) and what difference is caused by it being blessed/normal/cursed?

2. If you polymorph into a dragon, and lay an egg, the egg is in your
   inventory as food...  If you eat an egg of a certain dragon type, does it
   have the same effect ( ie: intrinsicts, et al ) as eating the dragon itself?

3. I had a natural 'naked' armour class of 11!?  I assume it was caused by
   giving money to the priest in the temple-ish looking place, but I'm not
   certain.

4. I was polymorphed into a Wumpus and, whilst kicking a sink, a Black Pudding
   showed up, killed it in one round ( the Wumpus gets 4 attacks ), and ate
   the thing... "You feel healthy". Great! poison resistance!
   On another game a managed to kill a Black Pudding ( with alot of help from
   a ring of invisibility, speed boots, and various miscellaneous weapons ),
   I ate this one... "You feel full of hot air". Cold resistance!?
   Now, are there some monsters that can give you more than one intrinsic when
   you eat them?

5. A horn of fire!?  Now there's a novel item (saved my 'presumed dead' hiney
   from those water moccisins too, let me tell you)

6. Had a pet succubus, who went around hitting on and hitting upon the various
   nasties I encountered in the dungeon ( she never seemed to eat anything
   eather, which was great. Left more for me... ). Now The Happy Hooker, as
   she was known, would occassionaly take an item from a creature before, she
   did the moody-thing and bashed them into oblivion, but these items that
   she took in this way, she'd never drop!  How do you get your pet to drop
   these sorts of items? ( I assume a nymph would have the same 'collector'
   mentallity )

7. Is there any way to get intrinsic telepathy besides eating a floating eye
   or becoming the Hand of Elbereth?

8. Is it OK for chaotically aligned characters to kill peacefull monsters they
   encounter? ( they being chaotic after all ) Without it adversely affecting
   my luck or alignment that is.

